+| 1 | ≥k prior failures ⇒ `recall_check` on the job entry **and** in state.json via `--recall-check-json`, prompt carries the section with evidence **and the reading-budget instruction**; fewer ⇒ neither | Live re-emit of this run's own manifest (below): `emitter-recall` → `tighten`, artefact written, `--recall-check-json` on its `register-lane`, section present with 2 evidence lines; `docs`/`spec-review` → `none`, neither. State.json path proven by the selftest. **But the reading-budget instruction is not the specified one.** | ❌ (ISSUE 1) |
